ajo@wopr ~/tmp2 >gcc -pg -o test test.cc -lm -static
test.cc: In function `int main()':
test.cc:3: warning: implicit declaration of function `int printf(...)'
ajo@wopr ~/tmp2 >./test
Test
ajo@wopr ~/tmp2 >

